{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29146","headline":"酬绵州于中丞使君见寄 · 许浑","name":"酬绵州于中丞使君见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"故人书信越襃斜，新意虽多旧约赊。\n皆就一麾先去国，共谋三迳未还家。\n荆巫夜隔巴西月，鄢郢春连汉上花。\n半月离居犹怅望，可堪垂白各天涯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29146.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29146","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}